@Transactional
public TokenPair rotate(String presentedValue) {
    RefreshToken current = repository.findForUpdate(hash(presentedValue))
        .orElseThrow(InvalidGrantException::new);

    if (current.isExpired() || current.isRevoked()) {
        repository.revokeFamily(current.familyId());
        throw new InvalidGrantException();
    }

    current.revoke();
    RefreshToken replacement = RefreshToken.nextInFamily(current.familyId());
    repository.save(replacement);
    return new TokenPair(issueAccessToken(current.subject()), replacement.plainValueOnce());
}
```
*Store a one-way hash of the refresh token where possible, rotate inside one transaction, and define how reuse of an old family member is detected and handled.*
